{"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ensemblesbox"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/documentation\/EnsemblesBox"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"topicSections":[{"title":"Cloud File System","identifiers":["doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/documentation\/EnsemblesBox\/BoxCloudFileSystem"],"anchor":"Cloud-File-System"}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Framework","modules":[{"name":"EnsemblesBox"}],"externalID":"EnsemblesBox","role":"collection","symbolKind":"module","title":"EnsemblesBox"},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"EnsemblesBox provides ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/documentation\/EnsemblesBox\/BoxCloudFileSystem","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", an implementation of the Ensembles ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CloudFileSystem"},{"text":" protocol that stores sync data on ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/www.box.com","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":". It uses the official Box Swift SDK (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BoxSdkGen"},{"text":") for all API operations.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Box is widely used in enterprise environments and offers strong administrative controls, compliance features, and large storage quotas.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"The-ID-Problem","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"The ID Problem"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Unlike path-based services (pCloud, WebDAV, S3), Box identifies every file and folder by a numeric ID. The Ensembles "},{"code":"CloudFileSystem","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol uses string paths like "},{"code":"ensembleId\/events\/file.json","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/documentation\/EnsemblesBox\/BoxCloudFileSystem","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" bridges this gap by walking the folder hierarchy to resolve paths to Box IDs, caching the mappings to minimize API calls."}]},{"anchor":"Authentication","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Authentication"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Box supports multiple authentication methods (OAuth 2.0, Developer Token, Client Credentials Grant, JWT). Your app creates and configures a ","type":"text"},{"code":"BoxClient","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" with the appropriate auth, then injects it:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import EnsemblesBox","import BoxSdkGen","","\/\/ Developer token (for testing)","let auth = BoxDeveloperTokenAuth(token: \"your-dev-token\")","let boxClient = BoxClient(auth: auth)","let cloudFileSystem = BoxCloudFileSystem(client: boxClient)"]},{"text":"Setup","level":3,"anchor":"Setup","type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let ensemble = CoreDataEnsemble(","    ensembleIdentifier: \"MainStore\",","    persistentStoreURL: storeURL,","    managedObjectModelURL: modelURL,","    cloudFileSystem: BoxCloudFileSystem(client: boxClient)",")","try await ensemble?.attachPersistentStore()"],"type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Path Resolution and Caching","level":3,"anchor":"Path-Resolution-and-Caching","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When Ensembles requests an operation on path "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\/ensembleId\/events\/file.json"},{"type":"text","text":", the backend:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Starts at the Box root folder (ID "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"0\""},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Lists the root folder to find "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ensembleId"},{"type":"text","text":" and gets its folder ID."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Lists that folder to find "},{"code":"events","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and gets its folder ID."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Lists that folder to find "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"file.json"},{"type":"text","text":" and gets its file ID."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each resolved ID is cached in an internal dictionary. Subsequent operations on the same path skip the API calls. The cache is invalidated when items are deleted or when not-found errors suggest staleness."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Folder listings are paginated automatically (up to 1000 items per page) to handle large directories."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Error Handling","level":3,"anchor":"Error-Handling","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Box SDK errors are mapped to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EnsembleError"},{"type":"text","text":" cases:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Authentication failures (401, unauthorized) map to ","type":"text"},{"code":"EnsembleError\/authenticationFailure","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Not-found errors (404) map to ","type":"text"},{"code":"EnsembleError\/fileAccessFailed","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Conflict errors (409, item already exists) are handled internally with retry logic."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All other errors map to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EnsembleError\/serverError"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}]},{"anchor":"Dependencies","level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Dependencies"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This module depends on the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/box\/box-ios-sdk","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" v10+ (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BoxSdkGen"},{"text":" module). The SDK has zero external dependencies of its own.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A Box-based cloud backend for Ensembles.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://EnsemblesBox/documentation/EnsemblesBox/BoxCloudFileSystem":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"BoxCloudFileSystem","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"BoxCloudFileSystem"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/documentation\/EnsemblesBox\/BoxCloudFileSystem","title":"BoxCloudFileSystem","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ensemblesbox\/boxcloudfilesystem","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A cloud file system backed by Box, using the Box Swift SDK ("},{"code":"BoxSdkGen","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":").","type":"text"}]},"doc://EnsemblesBox/documentation/EnsemblesBox":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"A Box-based cloud backend for Ensembles.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"EnsemblesBox","identifier":"doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/documentation\/EnsemblesBox","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/ensemblesbox"},"https://github.com/box/box-ios-sdk":{"titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Box iOS SDK"}],"title":"Box iOS SDK","type":"link","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/box\/box-ios-sdk","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/box\/box-ios-sdk"},"https://www.box.com":{"titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Box"}],"title":"Box","type":"link","url":"https:\/\/www.box.com","identifier":"https:\/\/www.box.com"}}}